@page "/contact"

<PageTitle>Contact | It's About Bloody Time</PageTitle>

<section class="event-page information-page">
    <div class="page-heading">
        <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
        <h1>Contact</h1>
        <p class="page-introduction">We welcome questions, ideas, and feedback that can help make historical storytelling better.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="information-panel">
        <h2>Share your thoughts</h2>
        <p>Tell us about the timelines you would like to create, features that would improve your archive, or anything else that would help us improve. We are also happy to hear about a problem you have encountered while creating or exploring a timeline.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="information-panel">
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>Send your question, feedback, or support request to <a href="mailto:itsaboutbloodytime@the-fields.net">itsaboutbloodytime@the-fields.net</a>.</p>
        <p>Including the timeline title and a short description of what you were doing will help us understand your message more quickly.</p>
    </section>
</section>
